"P2998529016" "This is something that might concern you, {HeroName}. A contact I have in the Freakshow tells me that Dreck, the leader of the Freakshow, has ordered his men to hunt you down. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think it might be a good idea if you returned the favor and hunted the Freakshow right back.</A> "
// AcceptString :
"P1042830697" "Hunt the Freakshow right back"
// SendOffString :
"P3754705385" "The Freakshow aren't to be underestimated, they're tenacious and crazy. But if you can cause enough damage to them, even Dreck will realize that they don't need to antagonize you any more. If you're having trouble finding Freaks, a lot of them can be found in Independence Port, Talos Island, and Terra Volta."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2798132522" "Combat the Freakshow"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P166231417" "My contacts says the Freaks haven't gotten the message yet."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
