"P2371355561" "Talos Island is seeing a lot of Freakshow activity in the last few days, and it's making life difficult for people living there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The city is asking for heroes to fight the Freakshow in Talos Island.</a> When I heard that, I thought you might be able to help."
