"P3213713690" "I knew the city could count on you, {HeroName}. The Freaks didn't even know what hit them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Freakshow_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1730329041" "A lot of the city's power comes from the Reactor facility in Terra Volta. If the reactor were to go down, it would cause chaos in every zone of Paragon City. The Freakshow are all too aware of this, and would like nothing better than to see Terra Volta taken offline. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero who can go to Terra Volta and keep the Freakshow from causing more damage there.</A> "
// AcceptString :
"P656287447" "Defeat Freakshow in Terra Volta"
// SendOffString :
"P1384635947" "The Freakshow have been seen all over the zone, often blockading roads or fighting with other villains. If you're having trouble finding them, you could check the Walker Energy complex or the Savage Waste Disposal facility."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2076873164" "Combat Freakshow in Terra Volta"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1203885495" "The Freakshow will tear Terra Volta down and dance on the radioactive rubble, {HeroName}. That can't be allowed to happen."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2181392043" "You really fought the good fight against the Freakshow, {HeroName}. Terra Volta can keep running thanks to your efforts."
